      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but even a cup of coffee doesnt really do much for me lately. i feel like i need something more intense to actually get through these 10 hour study blocks. if i just took like a couple of the 200mg caffeine pills with my morning dose of ritalin, would that be okay to get through the week? i just need to stay sharp and cant afford to crash right now.",
